SC["c3t_watch"]={t:()=>SYS(`CHAPTER NINE — THE MEASURING ROD`)+P(`Semifinal morning, and you stop thinking about your own bracket entirely, because on the far stage <b>Iron Veil Ruan</b>, first disciple of Elder Kang, is taking apart a senior outer disciple the way a clerk takes apart an abacus.`)+P(`And you can SEE it. Every technique he launches runs along threads — out from his dantian, through shoulder, wrist, palm. Everyone's do. But watching him at full extension, the understanding lands like a dropped bell:`)+P(`<i>The threads run both ways.</i>`)+P(`A technique is a puppet string with the puppeteer holding the wrong end. If a weaver caught the string mid-cast and PULLED — a man could be struck down by his own mountain-crushing palm.`)+P(`In the stands above the far stage, for the first time all tournament, sits Elder Kang. He is not watching Ruan. He is watching you, with the comfortable patience of a man whose net is already in the water.`),
 c:()=>[{id:"c0",l:`Study Ruan's threads until the new Pattern sits whole in your hands.`,do:()=>{learn("puppet","Puppet Strings");if(G.insight>=6&&G.realm<2)realmUp();addIns(1);},go:"a2c9_bench"},
  {id:"c1",l:`Study Kang instead — the watcher above the stage, and what his stillness is made of.`,do:()=>{learn("puppet","Puppet Strings");if(G.insight>=6&&G.realm<2)realmUp();G.f.a2_kang_read=true;note("Kang's threads are wrong. Everyone's run out from the dantian; his run INWARD, hundreds of them, fine as spider-silk, drinking from somewhere under the mountain. You file it where you file the things that will matter later, and feel cold for an hour.");},go:"a2c9_bench"}]};

SC["a2c9_bench"]={t:()=>((G.f.a2_mei_remedy=="no")?(P(`The alchemists' bench announces its finalists at noon, and Mei is not among them — but her idea is. A boy from the rites office, third cousin to somebody, presents a meridian salve that follows the channel instead of fighting it, built on half the insight and none of the craft. He doesn't know about the knots at wrist and ankle, so he sands the kink down instead of turning it, and the examiners, who have never heard the better version, call it promising.`)+P(`Mei watches from the gallery with her hands folded, expression as neat as a sealed jar. You sit through every minute of it, because making yourself watch is the only honest part left of the advice you gave her. The boy advances. Promising, the examiners say again.`)+P(`She doesn't look at you afterward. “Sensible,” she says, to the air, and goes back to the infirmary tables.`)):(P(`The alchemists' bench announces its finalists at noon, and Mei is among them — outer-court herb girl, no hall, no patron, presenting a meridian salve that follows the channel instead of fighting it. The gallery comes to see a curiosity. The examiners stop writing inside two minutes, which Bao swears has never once happened.`)+P(`Then the eldest examiner sets down her brush and asks, mild as weather: “Channel-knot theory. Wrist and ankle. Which text, candidate?”`)+((G.f.a2_mei_remedy=="co")?(P(`And Mei answers with the paper trail the two of you built across three arguing nights — a re-derivation from two dull genuine texts and one inspired misreading, each step checkable, each step checked. The examiner pulls the texts. The trail holds. By the end the old woman is nodding the way examiners nod at the start of someone's biography.`)):(P(`The hall goes quiet. Mei's hands stay folded.`)+((G.mei>=5)?(P(`She lies the way a master forges: without hurry, without flourish, a village apothecary's daughter citing her grandmother's wash-yard remedies and three plausible texts, building your secret a provenance so ordinary it bores the examiner into believing it. Only you can see what it costs her, because only you know her hands well enough to see the fold tighten.`)):(P(`She lies — and it holds, mostly, the way a green knot holds: there's a beat where the examiner's brush hovers, where the provenance comes out one text short and a half-tone too rehearsed, and somewhere behind the judges' table a clerk makes a small note. The salve is too good to fail. She advances anyway. The note stays made.`)))))+P(`The judges confer and announce the bench's decision will be read at the Lantern Rite, with the tournament honors. Mei walks past you on her way out, eyes forward, and lets the back of her hand brush yours, once — payment, message, and warning in a single character.`))),
 c:()=>[{id:"c0",l:`The semifinal is in an hour. Carry it with you — you've earned the weight.`,hide:()=>(G.f.a2_mei_remedy!="no"),do:()=>{G.f.a2_mei_bench="robbed";},go:"a2c9_semi_pre"},
  {id:"c1",l:`The semifinal is in an hour.`,hide:()=>(G.f.a2_mei_remedy=="no"),do:()=>{G.f.a2_mei_bench=(G.f.a2_mei_remedy=="co"||G.mei>=5)?"star":"suspect";if(G.f.a2_mei_bench=="suspect"){G.f.a2_mei_suspect=true;};},go:"a2c9_semi_pre"}]};

SC["a2c9_semi_pre"]={t:()=>P(`The board posts it in characters a foot tall: the gold-haired servant against Iron Veil Ruan. Of course it does. The net was always sized for this fish, this stage, this audience — Kang in the stands wants your measure taken in public, and Ruan is the rod he keeps for measuring.`)+P(`You have an hour, and a choice about what to do with your eyes.`),
 c:()=>[{id:"c0",l:`Find Ruan's warm-up court and read his rhythm — the seam where iron becomes water, and what comes the heartbeat before it.`,req:()=>(G.insight>=8),rq:"(needs Insight 8)",do:()=>{G.f.a2_ruan_read=true;note("You watch him run the veil up and down his body like a scale-exercise, and there — the half-breath of stillness each time, the same every time, a hinge in the rhythm wide enough to hang a knot on. You will have him bound before the gong stops ringing.");},go:"c3t_final"},
  {id:"c1",l:`Sit with your back to the stage wall, breathe the way an old woman taught you, and let your threads come all the way home.`,do:()=>{G.thr=G.maxthr;G.hp=Math.min(G.maxhp,G.hp+5);note("+5 HP, threads full. The wall is cold. The breathing is older than the wall.");},go:"c3t_final"}]};

SC.c3t_final={img:"trials",combat:"ruan",win:"c3t_victory",lose:"c3t_loss",
 t:()=>P("The gong sounds. Ruan does not charge. He walks, iron climbing over his skin joint by joint, and the crowd goes very quiet.")+
 SYS("The veil braces and the veil flows \u2014 read it. His Mountain-Crushing Palm is one long, beautiful thread: Unravel it, Mirror it, or pull it home with Puppet Strings."),
 cstart:()=>{if(G.f.a2_ruan_read){C.snared=true;clog('<span class="good">The hinge in his rhythm opens \u2014 and your knot is already in it. Ruan starts the match bound.</span>');}}};


SC["c3t_victory"]={t:()=>P(`It ends with Ruan flat on his back, struck down — the crowd will argue about this for years — by what witnesses swear was his own palm.`)+P(`Silence. Then the lower terraces, the servant terraces, come apart. Bao is screaming himself hoarse. Mei is crying and pretending it's the incense. Somewhere in the roar you can hear the Pine-Crane bench, and a knife-bright laugh that can only be Lin.`)+P(`You take the final the next morning almost as an afterthought — a polished inner-court swordsman who has watched your matches and wants no part of what he watched; it goes the distance, and then it goes your way. You take the robe. The steward's office, white-faced, clears the household debts of every placing entrant in front of everyone, and the basement makes a sound you will remember on your deathbed, whichever world that's in.`)+P(`And Elder Kang rises from his seat, smiling like a man whose ship has come in, and his voice carries effortlessly across the plaza: “Remarkable. Such a treasure must be properly honored. At the Lantern Rite, the sect will receive this child <i>personally</i>.”`)+P(`It sounds like an invitation. It lands like a door closing.`),
 c:()=>[{id:"c0",l:`Continue`,do:()=>{G.f.trialsWon=true;G.mei++;note("Mei +1");G.hp=G.maxhp;if(G.f.a2_ring=="staked"){note("Bao meets you at the stage steps with your pledged purse and his cleared slate, and shakes your hand like a business partner, which, you realize, he now is.");G.bao++;};},go:"c4_open"}]};

SC["c3t_loss"]={t:()=>P(`The Mountain-Crushing Palm finds you once — once is enough — and you wake on the medics' mat with the bout gone and the crowd still buzzing.`)+P(`Because a kitchen servant took Kang's first disciple to the wire, and everybody saw it. Ruan himself limps over, regards you for a long moment, and gives you a full bow, a degree deeper than courtesy requires. “The measuring rod,” he says quietly, “has been measured.” Top sixteen still means robes; your placing still clears the basement's household debts, and the steward's office reads the list with a face like vinegar.`)+P(`In the stands, Elder Kang is already gone — but a steward finds you before sundown: at the Lantern Rite, the sect wishes to honor the gold-haired servant <i>personally</i>. It sounds like an invitation. It lands like a door closing.`),
 c:()=>[{id:"c0",l:`Take the loss apart on the medics' mat: where the palm came from, and what your reading missed.`,do:()=>{addIns(1);G.mei++;note("Mei +1");G.hp=G.maxhp;if(G.f.a2_ring=="staked"){note("Your pledged purse survives on your placing — smaller, but Bao's slate clears with two coppers to spare. He frames one of them.");G.bao++;};},go:"c4_open"},
  {id:"c1",l:`Let Mei scold you while she splints your fingers, and keep the evening.`,do:()=>{G.mei+=2;note("Mei +2");G.hp=G.maxhp;if(G.f.a2_ring=="staked"){note("Your pledged purse survives on your placing — smaller, but Bao's slate clears with two coppers to spare. He frames one of them.");G.bao++;};},go:"c4_open"}]};